{"id":"2adc90a7b77db618","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-ideal-quotient-boolean-algebra.md","title":"ZFC Ideal Quotient Boolean Algebra","display":"df-zfc-ideal-quotient-boolean-algebra — ZFC Ideal Quotient Boolean Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal-quotient-boolean-algebra","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal-quotient-boolean-algebra"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal-quotient-boolean-algebra — ZFC Ideal Quotient Boolean Algebra","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-boolean-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal-quotient-boolean-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal-quotient-boolean-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal-quotient-boolean-algebra — ZFC Ideal Quotient Boolean Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"58-df-boolean-algebra\">58-df-boolean-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,I,Q\\in V\">\\(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,I,Q\\in V\\)</span> (Boolean-algebra structure, ideal, and quotient carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean}\">\\(\\mathrm{Boolean}\\)</span> (six-argument Boolean-algebra predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanQuotientStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanQuotientStructure}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdealQuotientBooleanAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdealQuotientBooleanAlgebra}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S(I,B,\\wedge,\\vee,0)\\leftrightarrow I\\subseteq B\\land0\\in I\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(a\\vee b\\in I)\\land\\forall a\\in I\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(b\\wedge a=b\\to b\\in I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S(I,B,\\wedge,\\vee,0)\\leftrightarrow I\\subseteq B\\land0\\in I\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(a\\vee b\\in I)\\land\\forall a\\in I\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(b\\wedge a=b\\to b\\in I)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{BooleanQuotientStructure}_S(Q,B,I,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land\\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S(I,B,\\wedge,\\vee,0)\\land Q=\\bigl\\{\\{c\\in B:((b\\wedge\\neg c)\\vee(c\\wedge\\neg b))\\in I\\}:b\\in B\\bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{BooleanQuotientStructure}_S(Q,B,I,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land\\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S(I,B,\\wedge,\\vee,0)\\land Q=\\bigl\\{\\{c\\in B:((b\\wedge\\neg c)\\vee(c\\wedge\\neg b))\\in I\\}:b\\in B\\bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealQuotientBooleanAlgebra}_S(Q,B,I)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\in V\\;\\mathrm{BooleanQuotientStructure}_S(Q,B,I,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealQuotientBooleanAlgebra}_S(Q,B,I)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\in V\\;\\mathrm{BooleanQuotientStructure}_S(Q,B,I,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The quotient uses Boolean symmetric difference and the Boolean order, rather than set difference and union on arbitrary algebra elements. The carrier-level form existentially binds the algebra operations.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,I,Q\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Boolean}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BooleanQuotientStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcIdealQuotientBooleanAlgebra}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S(I,B,\\wedge,\\vee,0)\\leftrightarrow I\\subseteq B\\land0\\in I\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(a\\vee b\\in I)\\land\\forall a\\in I\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(b\\wedge a=b\\to b\\in I)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{BooleanQuotientStructure}_S(Q,B,I,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land\\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S(I,B,\\wedge,\\vee,0)\\land Q=\\bigl\\{\\{c\\in B:((b\\wedge\\neg c)\\vee(c\\wedge\\neg b))\\in I\\}:b\\in B\\bigr\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealQuotientBooleanAlgebra}_S(Q,B,I)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\in V\\;\\mathrm{BooleanQuotientStructure}_S(Q,B,I,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)","display":true}],"bytes":1806,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2283","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-ideal-quotient-boolean-algebra.md|58-df-zfc-ideal-quotient-boolean-algebra]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a5e10857074b912e"]}